Project Title
Pocket Smart AI – Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

## Functional Requirements
- User can enter income details.
- User can enter daily expenses.
- User can select expense categories.
- User can set a monthly budget.
- System calculates total expenses.
- System calculates the remaining balance.
- System analyzes spending patterns.
- System provides budget recommendations.

## Software Requirements
- Python
- Python IDE / VS Code
- GitHub
- Required Python libraries

## Hardware Requirements
- Computer or Laptop
- Minimum 4 GB RAM
- Internet connection
